          "label_cn": "线，缝纫线；线索，脉络；（论坛的）帖子串，话题；线程；螺纹",
          "label_en": "a fine cord of twisted fibers used in sewing and weaving; a theme or idea running through a story or argument; a sequence of messages on a forum or social media; a unit of execution in computing; a screw thread",
